{
  "slug": "ido4shape",
  "name": "Ido4shape",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A specification discovery plugin for Cowork and Claude Code. Helps product managers, founders, and tech leads figure out what to build before writing a single line of code.\n\nUnlike tools that assume you already know what to build, ido4shape starts at \"tell me about your problem\" and guides you through creative, non-linear conversation — reading your documents, asking the questions that matter, surfacing risks you hadn't considered, and tracking understanding across multiple sessions via a persistent knowledge canvas.\n\nWhen understanding is deep enough, it synthesizes a structured strategic specification with capability groups, dependencies, priorities, risk assessments, and verifiable success conditions. Independent parallel reviewers (technical feasibility, scope alignment, dependency audit, format quality) catch issues before the spec is finalized.\n\nThe output is a standalone markdown document you can hand to your team, feed to any AI coding tool, or use as a project brief. For teams using ido4 MCP, the strategic spec can be automatically decomposed into implementation-ready technical tasks.\n\n10 skills (6 user-invocable, 4 auto-triggered), 5 sub-agents, deterministic spec validation, multi-session persistence, zero external dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**, **5 agents** and **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `artifact-format` (This skill provides strategic spec artifact format knowledge), `create-spec` (This skill guides users through creative specification development), `creative-decomposition` (This skill provides conversation methodology for creative specification work), `dependency-analysis` (This skill provides dependency graph knowledge), `quality-guidance` (This skill provides strategic spec quality standards), `refine-spec` (This skill edits existing spec artifacts using natural language instructions), `review-spec` (This skill launches parallel independent reviewers to assess the canvas or spec artifact before composition), `stakeholder-brief` (This skill generates a stakeholder-specific briefing from the current canvas), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (5): `canvas-synthesizer` (Performs the reasoning-intensive crystallization from knowledge canvas to strategic spec artifact), `dependency-auditor` (Audits the dependency graph in spec artifacts or canvas), `scope-reviewer` (Reviews spec artifacts or canvas for scope alignment), `spec-reviewer` (Reviews strategic spec artifacts for format compliance and content quality), `technical-reviewer` (Reviews spec artifacts or canvas for technical feasibility)\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `PreToolUse`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreCompact`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ido4shape@claude-community` from `ido4-dev/ido4shape`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 10,
    "agent": 5,
    "hook": 5
  },
